{"hash": "d4935cc2d1ce8e3d275f3c8db91bc6340d3306d409022c8b9eb1e3d536054b22", "id": "T-t1-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "genesis", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 7, "line_start": 7, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. A human must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "5ae82dbb152cb49c84a15b834661679fd39eb9d61470cc1eda285dec6f0c5bef", "id": "T-t1-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d4935cc2d1ce8e3d275f3c8db91bc6340d3306d409022c8b9eb1e3d536054b22", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 8, "line_start": 8, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. An agent must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "03cbcd2722ea4196d356dd57b0c8a4797ad99f04aaae1fbfcd8c5e5c67818afc", "id": "T-t1-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "5ae82dbb152cb49c84a15b834661679fd39eb9d61470cc1eda285dec6f0c5bef", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 9, "line_start": 9, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. An internal or external event must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "7a7e09ea524a87004ea6c6f065ac8032e6e0a42fe080176c69f7444daa68b6cb", "id": "T-t2-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "03cbcd2722ea4196d356dd57b0c8a4797ad99f04aaae1fbfcd8c5e5c67818afc", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 13, "line_start": 13, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Composability hides the complexity.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "5611e7e7a008bf9c4ec695db47acfbe7f667c696a13d23928facbe7119051198", "id": "T-t2-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "7a7e09ea524a87004ea6c6f065ac8032e6e0a42fe080176c69f7444daa68b6cb", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 14, "line_start": 14, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Composability allows enhancing particular aspects of any element without touching the rest.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "6c45d5a71f91c7066b0e28109ac559c27526ecec4857cd2ee46e0c182c508c67", "id": "T-t2-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "5611e7e7a008bf9c4ec695db47acfbe7f667c696a13d23928facbe7119051198", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 15, "line_start": 15, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. State, telemetry, and every cross-cutting concern are managed across the entire structure, whichever entry point was used.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "82700fd41874f5f8b0689cf34e495659a9e096c71f265e491f8266e12d73a6f3", "id": "T-t3-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "6c45d5a71f91c7066b0e28109ac559c27526ecec4857cd2ee46e0c182c508c67", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 19, "line_start": 19, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. It has to be simple to use.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "9d4e7f8f8ed6e0c9067327be73e0fc77ba94cac2583ebf99196d1131064f8f59", "id": "T-t3-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "82700fd41874f5f8b0689cf34e495659a9e096c71f265e491f8266e12d73a6f3", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 20, "line_start": 20, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. It cannot be daunting or overly complex, or no one will use it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "83afad1ebc47453a8bb82a12df54bb7bf611c658e4bd0afa7a90fc5ddbaba0e8", "id": "T-t4-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "9d4e7f8f8ed6e0c9067327be73e0fc77ba94cac2583ebf99196d1131064f8f59", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 24, "line_start": 24, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Treat this as a baseline target and improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "28639df7ca36d6768f7f8993fbda279d86fc37fd6a29478e5d56108110a428ee", "id": "T-t4-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "83afad1ebc47453a8bb82a12df54bb7bf611c658e4bd0afa7a90fc5ddbaba0e8", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 25, "line_start": 25, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Decompose it; add the skills, loops, and agents needed to reach it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "2c525131c2b0ba82a6f4740db67636ad460bf8fe7b12685e4c7cb49b01d57382", "id": "T-t4-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "28639df7ca36d6768f7f8993fbda279d86fc37fd6a29478e5d56108110a428ee", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 26, "line_start": 26, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. PASS.md's list is a limited baseline: understand what an end-to-end version is, make up for the gaps, and solve it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "313fab2c8063390d973953ad9fdad75283b8cde9db369b9a1f6832bc5f5ac11c", "id": "T-t4-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "2c525131c2b0ba82a6f4740db67636ad460bf8fe7b12685e4c7cb49b01d57382", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 27, "line_start": 27, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Work through every item with a self-improvement loop: at the end of each section a ceremony re-reviews the output, improves the skills that produced it, and the loop continues.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "04daf156b2698c2ed9cf783b36570363c65c3c9322408e3ca5d55eb5129a5fd0", "id": "T-t5-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "313fab2c8063390d973953ad9fdad75283b8cde9db369b9a1f6832bc5f5ac11c", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 31, "line_start": 31, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Do not stop at ceremonies; run them and continue.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "e1e0220e4827faa61377b79611ed767976d32880f7a6c78ef1af0cdbdc41d8ed", "id": "T-t5-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "04daf156b2698c2ed9cf783b36570363c65c3c9322408e3ca5d55eb5129a5fd0", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 32, "line_start": 32, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. When a problem comes up, use 1-3-1: define the problem, identify the three best possible solutions that align to the goal, and follow the recommendation.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "47d43cd6c8d4e5d6bb7db7d48a6669af0723b410c20455d9457bed44310b3540", "id": "T-t5-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "e1e0220e4827faa61377b79611ed767976d32880f7a6c78ef1af0cdbdc41d8ed", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 33, "line_start": 33, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. If no recommendation is found, drop the two lowest solutions, find two more, and repeat until solved.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d969167a1e5d0bdbd771104778eb63ec30765ec64120f15c909019e7be11caa2", "id": "T-t6-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "47d43cd6c8d4e5d6bb7db7d48a6669af0723b410c20455d9457bed44310b3540", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 37, "line_start": 37, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. There is one way to consume the platform, shown as code end to end: what is called, with what, and what comes back.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "9d7f22363e0b31d2d9d974a9b1959b6a9e2db6edd23a43c7b64ae419dc439889", "id": "T-t6-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d969167a1e5d0bdbd771104778eb63ec30765ec64120f15c909019e7be11caa2", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 38, "line_start": 38, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Four entries cover nearly every situation: a human, an event, a schedule (time), and an external system or agent. All four enter through the same shape.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "0512ceb0b90e4f7612119b2102da9d00b43efb2e18d2fd16d46fb062f72ffe02", "id": "T-t6-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "9d7f22363e0b31d2d9d974a9b1959b6a9e2db6edd23a43c7b64ae419dc439889", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 39, "line_start": 39, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Any entry can call complex workflows, agents, and loops that run across the entire stack.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "b8e7072421b0926d630cc0e28b766763a9702615f1be355c570b6576d2d57a43", "id": "T-t6-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "0512ceb0b90e4f7612119b2102da9d00b43efb2e18d2fd16d46fb062f72ffe02", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 40, "line_start": 40, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Multiple models are used through one gateway, and a fleet of GPUs serves local models; callers request a model class, not a vendor.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "f5f67809e48ec23b4f39c8daed7274a56fb570cbad56ffe7f6605644eaa47576", "id": "T-t6-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "b8e7072421b0926d630cc0e28b766763a9702615f1be355c570b6576d2d57a43", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 41, "line_start": 41, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Each agent is defined up front by what it is good at, so callers know how to call it and how to sequence it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "cf7a4a4620eb71132a5dc618875acf2520a354da4adb8a5b1ab7050cb4aabdf0", "id": "T-t6-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "f5f67809e48ec23b4f39c8daed7274a56fb570cbad56ffe7f6605644eaa47576", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 42, "line_start": 42, "sha256": "d9061f0d0f3ab29aba018fe007e6c4b4e993aadef0fe54f2db228172513c56a1"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. The target scale is well over a hundred agents running at a time, working together, managing state, breaking problems down, and self-improving where they can.", "type": "fact"}
